<title>HONG KONG: Shanghai Industrial seen seeking loan.</title>
<headline>Shanghai Industrial seen seeking loan.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shanghai Industrial Holdings is expected to seek financing via an US$80 million loan facilty, bankers said.</p>
<p>They said the amortising loan is expected to have a final maturity of five years. The all-in return for top-tier managers is rumored to be around 80 basis points over the London Interbank Offered Rate, they said.</p>
<p>They said the deal will be completed on a club basis.</p>
<p>Sanwa Bank is tipped to be close to receiving a mandate to arrange the loan.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2847 4039</p>
</text>
